    "detailed_description": "Build your dream gym with Ultimate Gym Simulator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild Your Dream Gym<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart with a small gym, buy gym equipments, keep your gym clean, increase your reputation and build the best gym ever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGym Equipments<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBench press, cable machine, treadmill, smith machine, and much more. Buy different gym equipments to make your gym bigger and make your customers happy. Having more gym equipments will attract more customers. You also need to repair your gym equipments when they broken.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReputation is Important<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep your gym clean, beat up disturbing people, buy new gym equipments to have high reputation and get more people to your gym. Punching innocent people may harm your reputation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent Characters<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome people may enter your gym without get a membership some of them can throw bottle to ground, having this kind of people in your gym can make other people unhappy. Every people have different expectations for your gym. If you have dirty gym or if you lack some gym equipment you may miss some of the potential customers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCombat<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can attack anyone. You can punch and kick other people also block your opponent's strikes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize Your Gym and Expand<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can paint the walls of your gym. Expanding your gym is also very important to get more space and buy new equipment.",
    "about_the_game": "Build your dream gym with Ultimate Gym Simulator<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild Your Dream Gym<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart with a small gym, buy gym equipments, keep your gym clean, increase your reputation and build the best gym ever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGym Equipments<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBench press, cable machine, treadmill, smith machine, and much more. Buy different gym equipments to make your gym bigger and make your customers happy. Having more gym equipments will attract more customers. You also need to repair your gym equipments when they broken.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReputation is Important<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep your gym clean, beat up disturbing people, buy new gym equipments to have high reputation and get more people to your gym. Punching innocent people may harm your reputation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent Characters<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome people may enter your gym without get a membership some of them can throw bottle to ground, having this kind of people in your gym can make other people unhappy. Every people have different expectations for your gym. If you have dirty gym or if you lack some gym equipment you may miss some of the potential customers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCombat<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can attack anyone. You can punch and kick other people also block your opponent's strikes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize Your Gym and Expand<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can paint the walls of your gym. Expanding your gym is also very important to get more space and buy new equipment.",
